    ["%s尝试从潜意识海洋中唤醒你，是否接受？"] = "%s is attempting to awaken you from the Subconscious Ocean. Do you accept?",
    ["1. 语音房间最多可容纳1000人。\n2. 演唱会语音房间默认是房主设置发言顺序模式，需点击开麦按钮发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可开麦。\n3. 房主可在成员权限设置处调整发言顺序，设置禁言和房间黑名单，也可在右侧侧边栏设置界面，调整房间信息、进行常驻房间续时、转让房主操作。\n4. 在右侧侧边框可分享语音房间链接、发放语音房间礼金。"] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Concert voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
