    ["<Assistant_Title1>【烟囱里的孩子】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>工厂附近传来醉汉的责骂声和孩子的哭声，发生了什么事？\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>64级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(974,1173)]|-2552;17366;-1828;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Child in the Chimney】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Variety</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Drunken scolding and a child's crying are coming from near the factory. What happened?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>64</>, go to {Location:[Tingen(974,1173)]|-2552;17366;-1828;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soule, Invoices, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>困难·子嗣守护</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-团队副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>击杀困难难度子嗣守护"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Hard · Offspring Protection</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Defeat Offspring Protection on Hard difficulty",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>秘银缝制·永生花\n花香会抚慰所有不甘于沉眠的灵魂。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Mithril Sewing · Preserved Flower\nThe fragrance of flowers will soothe all souls unwilling to sleep.",
    ["<P_Heart>（不得不说，这样的日子还是很幸福的……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I have to say, a life like this is still quite blissful...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（望向远处）</>再唱首歌，很慢很慢的那种，跑调了也没关系，反正羊不会笑话我。"] = "<P_Heart> (Looking into the distance) </> Then sing a song, a very, very slow one; it doesn't matter if I'm off-key, the sheep won't laugh at me anyway.",
    ["<P_Heart>（这种人不教训一下，看来是不会长记性了。）</> "] = "<P_Heart> (If this kind of person isn't taught a lesson, it seems he won't learn.) </>",
    ["<Title>巨龙现身</>\n巨龙·投影于每周五晚的猎杀时刻开启<Highlight>10分钟后</>，即<Highlight>19:10</>，现身<Highlight>猎龙城王城中心</>。若20:00前未被击退，巨龙将离开，且不触发击杀结算。\n\n<Title>归属伤害</>\n仅在巨龙周围<Highlight>40米</>内存活并对其造成伤害时，伤害才会计入玩家当前所在团队。巨龙被击退时，<Highlight>当前有效归属伤害最高的团队</>获得最终归属及拍卖奖励。靠近巨龙后，可实时查看当前归属伤害。\n\n<Title>伤害衰减</>\n玩家死亡、离开巨龙讨伐范围、切换分线或离开团队后，该玩家已为团队累计的归属伤害将开始衰减，并同步影响团队当前的有效归属伤害。\n\n触发衰减后的<Highlight>前5秒</>，归属伤害保持不变；从第6秒开始，<Highlight>每6秒减少原累计归属伤害的5%</>，持续120秒后归零。\n\n重新进入<Highlight>巨龙讨伐范围</>并恢复参战后，衰减停止。当前剩余的归属伤害将被保留，并在此基础上继续累计新造成的伤害。\n\n<Title>拍卖奖励</>\n击退巨龙后，将根据激战值开启对应档位的拍卖。<Highlight>激战值越高，可开启的拍卖奖励档位越高</>。\n\n<Title>资格限制</>\n每次猎杀时刻活动中，每名玩家至多获得<Highlight>1次</>巨龙·投影的终末猎杀拍卖资格；已取得资格的玩家，本次活动内无法再次取得。"] = "<Title>Giant Dragon Appearance</>\nThe Giant Dragon - Projection appears at the <Highlight>center of the Dragon Hunting City Royal City</> 10 minutes after the <Highlight>Hunting Time</> starts on Friday night, which is <Highlight>19:10</>. If it is not repelled before 20:00, the Giant Dragon will leave, and the kill settlement will not be triggered. \n\n<Title>Attribution Damage</>\nDamage is only counted towards the player's current team if they are alive within <Highlight>40 meters</> of the Giant Dragon and dealing damage to it. When the Giant Dragon is repelled, the <Highlight>team with the highest current effective attribution damage</> receives the final attribution and auction rewards. After approaching the Giant Dragon, you can view the current attribution damage in real-time. \n\n<Title>Damage Decay</>\nAfter a player dies, leaves the Giant Dragon crusade range, switches channels, or leaves the team, the attribution damage that player has accumulated for the team will begin to decay, and this will synchronously affect the team's current effective attribution damage. \n\nFor the <Highlight>first 5 seconds</> after decay is triggered, the attribution damage remains unchanged; starting from the 6th second, <Highlight>it decreases by 5% of the original accumulated attribution damage every 6 seconds</>, and reaches zero after 120 seconds. \n\nAfter re-entering the <Highlight>Giant Dragon crusade range</> and resuming combat, the decay stops. The current remaining attribution damage will be retained, and new damage dealt will continue to be accumulated on this basis. \n\n<Title>Auction Rewards</>\nAfter repelling the Giant Dragon, auctions for corresponding tiers will be opened based on the Intense Battle Value. <Highlight>The higher the Intense Battle Value, the higher the tier of auction rewards that can be opened</>. \n\n<Title>Qualification Restrictions</>\nIn each Hunting Time event, each player can obtain the qualification for the Giant Dragon - Projection's Final Hunt auction at most <Highlight>1 time</>; players who have already obtained the qualification cannot obtain it again during this event.",
